{"concept":"fate","groups":[{"id":"fateful-outcome","name":{"ru":"Роковой исход","en":"Fateful outcome"},"count":6},{"id":"lot","name":{"ru":"Удел","en":"Lot"},"count":8},{"id":"necessity","name":{"ru":"Необходимость и поворот нужды","en":"Necessity and turning of need"},"count":10},{"id":"fate","name":{"ru":"Судьба и назначение","en":"Fate and destiny"},"count":24},{"id":"redemption-formula","name":{"ru":"Формула спасения","en":"Redemption formula"},"count":3}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ffe3e2f171ce1ede21cccb1303df5a45","tos.text-unit.sid-ffe3e2f171ce1ede21cccb1303df5a45"]},"form":"Verhängniss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fateful-outcome","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Человек делает из своей добродетели своё тяготение и свою судьбу.","en":"One makes one’s virtue one’s inclination and destiny."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a12b7675dff6efae41024a9aa3b2ccfd","tos.text-unit.sid-a12b7675dff6efae41024a9aa3b2ccfd"]},"form":"Verhängniss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fateful-outcome","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Одна добродетель образует узел судьбы.","en":"One virtue forms a knot of fate."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4d21ce54a3329235b303dfa037b18226","tos.text-unit.sid-4d21ce54a3329235b303dfa037b18226"]},"form":"Verhängniss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fateful-outcome","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Случайный паяц способен стать человеческим роком.","en":"A chance jester can become a human fate."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bec35575dfbeffeccd6b27ccfb20bb1d","tos.text-unit.sid-bec35575dfbeffeccd6b27ccfb20bb1d"]},"form":"Loos","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"lot","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Множество добродетелей превращает человека в поле их борьбы.","en":"Many virtues turn a person into their battlefield."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fb7d674b5a709c0d22716da16915369a","tos.text-unit.sid-fb7d674b5a709c0d22716da16915369a"]},"form":"nothwendig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["necessity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Вражда добродетелей получает имя необходимого зла.","en":"The virtues’ hostility receives the name of necessary evil."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d90706f3da9a436c547c9e98284964a1","tos.text-unit.sid-d90706f3da9a436c547c9e98284964a1"]},"form":"Nothwendigen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["necessity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Там, где кончается государство, начинается человек, который необходим, и звучит песнь необходимых людей.","en":"Where the state ends, the necessary human begins, and the song of those who are necessary is heard."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ce332fb3562e0683265e279313ef6ddf","tos.text-unit.sid-ce332fb3562e0683265e279313ef6ddf"]},"form":"Loos","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"lot","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель освобождает друга от удела отгонять мух.","en":"The teacher releases the friend from the lot of chasing flies."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ad66afc5ca4ef0716f735681d5c9b293","tos.text-unit.sid-ad66afc5ca4ef0716f735681d5c9b293"]},"form":"Verhängniss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fateful-outcome","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра предостерегает: гордому может быть суждено выносить ядовитое насилие.","en":"Zarathustra warns that the proud one may be fated to endure poisonous violence."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a834f53277919bcbfe7ce582b6891945","tos.text-unit.sid-a834f53277919bcbfe7ce582b6891945"]},"form":"Loos","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"lot","neighbours":["loneliness","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Друг призван к уединению и суровому свежему воздуху.","en":"The friend is called to solitude and strong air."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.22","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c4f5fbf0dc658e2f2cd1217cb9c674de","tos.text-unit.sid-c4f5fbf0dc658e2f2cd1217cb9c674de"]},"form":"Loos","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"lot","neighbours":["will","becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Позднее созревание изображено судьбой кислых яблок.","en":"Late ripening is pictured as the fate of sour apples."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.22","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9ef8ffd094780bfefd97e7ad4b31f8cd","tos.text-unit.sid-9ef8ffd094780bfefd97e7ad4b31f8cd"]},"form":"Verhängniss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fateful-outcome","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Ранняя смерть Иисуса становится роковой для многих.","en":"Jesus’ early death becomes fateful for many."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2c810b780dd774ba2430062b27733b27","tos.text-unit.sid-2c810b780dd774ba2430062b27733b27"]},"form":"Nothwendigkeit","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["will","necessity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Единая воля и перемена всех потребностей, названная необходимостью, сопутствуют зарождению добродетели.","en":"A single will and the change of all needs, called necessity, accompany the birth of virtue."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-689b101d0eb2f848e7aaeddf6afe12fc","tos.text-unit.sid-689b101d0eb2f848e7aaeddf6afe12fc"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["will","creation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Созидающая воля хочет именно своей судьбы.","en":"Creative will desires precisely its own fate."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-036b3f887af319a4344c12f5cba0e57a","tos.text-unit.sid-036b3f887af319a4344c12f5cba0e57a"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра желает встреч с общей надеждой, трапезой и мёдом.","en":"Zarathustra desires encounters sharing hope, meal and honey."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.04","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5cdaacc933d2e918b3282b3728681c30","tos.text-unit.sid-5cdaacc933d2e918b3282b3728681c30"]},"form":"Verhängniss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fateful-outcome","neighbours":["tablets-values","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Ложные ценности хранят отложенную роковую опасность.","en":"False values harbour a delayed fateful danger."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f1ad6ce0aa27ac51824faadb59b07ce6","tos.text-unit.sid-f1ad6ce0aa27ac51824faadb59b07ce6"]},"form":"nothwendig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["necessity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Некоторые называют добродетель необходимой, а в душе верят только в необходимость полиции.","en":"Some call virtue necessary but believe in their hearts only in the necessity of the police."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-92100d37755442dc085adfd6df51f51b","tos.text-unit.sid-92100d37755442dc085adfd6df51f51b"]},"form":"Loos","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"lot","neighbours":["will","affirmation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра благословляет судьбу, по которой он перестал быть учёным для овец.","en":"Zarathustra blesses the fate that has made him no longer a scholar for the sheep."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5d7585f48e3c3ff7eef88bb204463cc3","tos.text-unit.sid-5d7585f48e3c3ff7eef88bb204463cc3"]},"form":"So wollte ich es","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"redemption-formula","neighbours":["will","creation","counterfactual","redemption","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Спасение превращает «было» в «так хотел я».","en":"Redemption transforms “it was” into “thus I willed it.”"}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-cad70ec5a95e4aa4ebec565f3f3a9d3b","tos.text-unit.sid-cad70ec5a95e4aa4ebec565f3f3a9d3b"]},"form":"so wollte ich es","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"redemption-formula","neighbours":["will","creation","counterfactual","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Созидающая воля отвечает прошлому: «Но так хотела я!»","en":"Creative will answers the past with its own willing."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4580a061a4a4bde3a41129411acdad02","tos.text-unit.sid-4580a061a4a4bde3a41129411acdad02"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Судьба требует от учителя быть без предвидения.","en":"The teacher’s destiny requires him to be without foresight."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f01007b0c34e4b315c4f81b8c954f640","tos.text-unit.sid-f01007b0c34e4b315c4f81b8c954f640"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["becoming","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Всякое будущее переживание получает образ странствия и восхождения.","en":"Every future experience receives the image of wandering and ascent."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1285df20aaf90c12e4e52c10f6462127","tos.text-unit.sid-1285df20aaf90c12e4e52c10f6462127"]},"form":"Loos","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"lot","neighbours":["loneliness","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Узнавание судьбы открывает последнее уединение.","en":"Recognizing one’s lot opens the final solitude."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5346c85e99233ec86b07bfb1eed987ba","tos.text-unit.sid-5346c85e99233ec86b07bfb1eed987ba"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Судьба и ночное море зовут учителя вниз.","en":"Fate and the night sea call the teacher downwards."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f6ce5a129b7557a406cf669a4d922a23","tos.text-unit.sid-f6ce5a129b7557a406cf669a4d922a23"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель объявляет готовность к глубочайшей боли своего пути.","en":"The teacher declares readiness for his path’s deepest pain."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0f931cad7efb80dddd0d9fa637de9e27","tos.text-unit.sid-1d1e6d8ca5971f35985ef3f0ba650b09"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"fate","neighbours":["great-noon","will"],"line":{"ru":"Преодолев печаль, учитель снова твёрдо стоит на пути своей судьбы.","en":"Having overcome his sadness, the teacher stands firmly again on the path of his destiny."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ff47d47b79cc419c35c4963e9b77639d","tos.text-unit.sid-ff47d47b79cc419c35c4963e9b77639d"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"fool","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["great-noon","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Огненные столбы должны предшествовать великому полудню; всему своё время и судьба.","en":"Pillars of fire must precede the great noon; everything has its time and destiny."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1bc2390de9b8f8aa7f40373d4d49e772","tos.text-unit.sid-1bc2390de9b8f8aa7f40373d4d49e772"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Даже небольшое различие полноты может заключать в себе судьбу.","en":"Even a small difference in fullness can contain destiny."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fb23cb044b07bb7f12da7e5f29161308","tos.text-unit.sid-fb23cb044b07bb7f12da7e5f29161308"]},"form":"Notwendigkeit","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["present","identity","necessity","gateway","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Время открывается опытом свободы самой необходимости.","en":"Time opens through an experience of necessity itself as freedom."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c1cdda843f95bcd960ce245cf3a90257","tos.text-unit.sid-c1cdda843f95bcd960ce245cf3a90257"]},"form":"so wollte ich es","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"redemption-formula","neighbours":["will","becoming","creation","counterfactual","redemption","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Прошлое должно быть спасено и преобразовано, пока воля не скажет: «Так хотела я! Так захочу я!»","en":"The past is to receive the will’s own desire."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-47c1eb4b90ead080cd3289e00e45c2da","tos.text-unit.sid-47c1eb4b90ead080cd3289e00e45c2da"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра сопоставляет две веры: во всевластную судьбу и во всевластную свободу.","en":"Zarathustra compares two beliefs: all-powerful fate and all-powerful freedom."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bde100d4594f5f1039e696cc0e21a8e5","tos.text-unit.sid-bde100d4594f5f1039e696cc0e21a8e5"]},"form":"nothwendigste","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["necessity","joy-lust","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Необходимейшая душа радостно бросается в случай.","en":"The most necessary soul plunges joyfully into chance."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-956ab805d5b26e53d7081461830706ea","tos.text-unit.sid-956ab805d5b26e53d7081461830706ea"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"fate","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель спрашивает, почему так мало рокового во взоре слушателей.","en":"The teacher asks why there is so little that is fateful in the listeners’ gaze."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1d780269b40b238cc1e3bc68daa1a477","tos.text-unit.sid-1d780269b40b238cc1e3bc68daa1a477"]},"form":"Schicksale","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"fate","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Чтобы побеждать вместе с Заратустрой, надо быть роковыми и неумолимыми.","en":"To conquer with Zarathustra one must be fateful and inexorable."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e3821f38fac71f7038b4a95e7d6c4553","tos.text-unit.sid-e3821f38fac71f7038b4a95e7d6c4553"]},"form":"Nothwendigkeit","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"will","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["will","necessity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Воля названа необходимостью и отдыхом от всякой нищеты.","en":"The will is called necessity and repose from all need."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a4383187b0dde022ee79e7eab7e8b156","tos.text-unit.sid-a4383187b0dde022ee79e7eab7e8b156"]},"form":"Schickung","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"will","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Воля получает имя судьбы души.","en":"Will receives the name of the soul’s fate."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-caea8bc50f96e7c3ac65756f152479d2","tos.text-unit.sid-caea8bc50f96e7c3ac65756f152479d2"]},"form":"Nothwendigkeit","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"will","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["will","necessity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Воля должна сохранить силы для одной большой победы.","en":"Will is to preserve strength for one great victory."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c673610b053fce15cebb48c6d3dce05e","tos.text-unit.sid-c673610b053fce15cebb48c6d3dce05e"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"animals","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["animals"],"line":{"ru":"Звери зовут песней исцелить душу для большой судьбы.","en":"The animals call for healing the soul through song for a great fate."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f25baa4e2fb13c32304bd277818b128c","tos.text-unit.sid-f25baa4e2fb13c32304bd277818b128c"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"animals","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["recurrence","becoming","animals"],"line":{"ru":"Звери называют учительство возвращения судьбой Заратустры.","en":"The animals call the teaching of recurrence Zarathustra’s fate."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-58fe19ce9170db311f80286870f4b7ee","tos.text-unit.sid-58fe19ce9170db311f80286870f4b7ee"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"animals","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["animals"],"line":{"ru":"Первое возвещение учения становится величайшей опасностью и болезнью.","en":"Being the first to proclaim the teaching becomes the greatest danger and sickness."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b29a3eda61993b0b40d197f03eb0b0cd","tos.text-unit.sid-b29a3eda61993b0b40d197f03eb0b0cd"]},"form":"Loos","speaker":"animals","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"lot","neighbours":["will","animals","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Предполагаемая речь принимает гибель вестника собственным уделом.","en":"The imagined speech accepts the herald’s perishing as his own lot."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1648b969311bd080ea1fb2577f23d573","tos.text-unit.sid-1648b969311bd080ea1fb2577f23d573"]},"form":"Wende der Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra-soul","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["identity","necessity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Освобождённая душа названа отдыхом от нищеты и судьбой.","en":"The liberated soul is named repose from need and destiny."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8b29e4a03e06217303b43c1122f23f95","tos.text-unit.sid-8b29e4a03e06217303b43c1122f23f95"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra-soul","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Душа переименована судьбой и пуповиной времени.","en":"The soul is renamed fate and time’s umbilical cord."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4d152f0293a13910b0d1b8c7281c3050","tos.text-unit.sid-4d152f0293a13910b0d1b8c7281c3050"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"fate","neighbours":["memory","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Судьба даёт учителю время; он спрашивает, не забыла ли она его и не ловит ли мух за камнем.","en":"Destiny gives the teacher time; he asks whether she has forgotten him or is catching flies behind a rock."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6efc8394fddc6c09a216c9e03532c285","tos.text-unit.sid-6efc8394fddc6c09a216c9e03532c285"]},"form":"Schicksale","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель благодарит судьбу за время для шуток и злобы.","en":"The teacher thanks destiny for time for jest and malice."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f3d06613f4cc8ae1d4d4f7a5919bd94d","tos.text-unit.sid-f3d06613f4cc8ae1d4d4f7a5919bd94d"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель и судьба терпеливо ждут того, кто должен прийти.","en":"The teacher and destiny patiently await the one who must come."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c426485935398df366b8fa2aa5419e0c","tos.text-unit.sid-c426485935398df366b8fa2aa5419e0c"]},"form":"Schicksale","speaker":"kings","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["becoming","earth","kings"],"line":{"ru":"Когда сильные земли не принадлежат к первым людям, всё становится лживым, кривым и чудовищным.","en":"A mismatch of power and human height distorts people’s fate."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c6ee5d296e454ae6a39cacfa8a6849f6","tos.text-unit.sid-c9ce295b75bbb81635a4f4231f6866a7"]},"form":"Loos","speaker":"magician","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"lot","neighbours":["will","attention","magician"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель принимает риск обмана как собственный удел.","en":"The teacher accepts deception’s risk as his own lot."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7b9e45f6f4fa2a56cd23a7d2aa9bab19","tos.text-unit.sid-7b9e45f6f4fa2a56cd23a7d2aa9bab19"]},"form":"Schicksal","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"last-pope","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Вкус благочестия допускает собственное создание судьбы.","en":"Piety’s taste permits making one’s own fate."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-251d3e1e961e759e21579013f7080236","tos.text-unit.sid-251d3e1e961e759e21579013f7080236"]},"form":"nothwendiger","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"necessity","neighbours":["becoming","necessity","memory","agency"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра засыпает, забыв о жажде, с открытыми глазами.","en":"Zarathustra falls asleep, forgetting his thirst, with his eyes open."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4d0f7408a6a794d4628d442bfbf3252b","tos.text-unit.sid-4d0f7408a6a794d4628d442bfbf3252b"]},"form":"nothwendiger","speaker":"soothsayer","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["identity","necessity","difference","soothsayer"],"line":{"ru":"Звери повторяют слова учителя: одно бывает необходимее другого.","en":"The animals repeat the teacher’s words: one thing is more necessary than another."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-489b30ca70e35b7b486968ce031e5939","tos.text-unit.sid-489b30ca70e35b7b486968ce031e5939"]},"form":"Schicksals","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"fate","neighbours":["will","becoming","nausea","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Претензия малых властвовать над судьбой вызывает отвращение.","en":"The small people’s claim to rule fate provokes disgust."}}]}
